              "text": "نشرت الصحيفة مقالا عن البحر. nasharat aṣ-ṣaḥīfa maqālan ʿan al-baḥr. The newspaper published an article about the sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural مقالات. مقالة is the same word."
            }
          ]
        },
