          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مقال (maqāl) is built on the native Arabic root q-w-l (Lane), \"to say\", the root of qāla. Maqāl is first \"a saying\"; in the modern press it is a written piece."
            }
          ]
