          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حرر (ḥarrara) is built on the native Arabic root ḥ-r-r (Lane), \"to be free\". It is Form II, \"to make free\", and of a text \"to write it out clean and correct\"."
            }
