              "text": "نشرة — nashra — \"a bulletin, a news broadcast\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شاهد أبي نشرة (nashra) الأخبار في المساء. shāhada abī nashrat al-akhbār fī al-masāʾ. My father watched the news bulletin in the evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نشرة (nashra) الأخبار is the news on radio or television."
            }
          ]
        },
