          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نشرة (nashra) is built on the native Arabic root n-sh-r (Lane), \"to spread out, to unfold\", the root of the taught nashara, to publish. A nashra is what is spread among people."
            }
          ]
        },
